                              Figure 1. (a) Digital image of SWCNT/PEDOT:PSS inks with different concentrations ((i) 12.5 mg/ml,
                              (ii) 0.3 mg/ml, (iii) 0.2 mg/ml, (iv); 0.1 mg/ml) and its TEM image (the scale bar is 50 nm); (b) Schematic
