                                  For comparison we also analyzed graphene/PEDOT:PSS film though graphene/PEDOT:PSS ink and found a
                              strong relationship between the graphene microstructure and baking conditions with brightness variation of the
                              film, as shown in Fig. S5. More specifically, brightness variation mainly results from the state-space transmission
                              of graphene sheets, with a gradually increasing angle between the substrate with increased heating rate.

